    "name": "Loan Servicing",
    "text": "Loan Servicing It is anticipated that ail Company loans will be “serviced” (i.c., loan payments will be collected and other administrative services performed) by the Servicer, which is expected also to act as either the initial lender or loan broker in connection with the origination of most or all Company loans. The Servicer will be compensated for such loan servicing activities. (See “iI. Management - Compensation to Management.”)"
