    "name": "Loan Diversification",
    "text": "Loan Diversification After the second year of the Company’s term, the Company will not enter into any new commitment to make a loan where the cumulative principal amount of tranches of such loan, as funded, exceeds 20% of the capital of the Company as of the date of such commitment,"
